    "source_location": "Manski (2013) is background for partial identification and effective-treatment modeling: §2.1, §3.1 (pp. S8-S9), §3.2 (pp. S9-S10), §5.1-§5.2 (pp. S19-S20). The numeric [3/7,4/7] is NOT from this paper.",
    "formula": "Target = (1/7) * sum_{i=1}^7 mu_i. Known: six leaf nodes have mu_i=1/2 in the full-assignment cell (own=1, exposure=1); the center has mu_center=1/2 in the cell (own=0, exposure=0), while mu_center in the full-assignment cell is only bounded in [0,1]. Therefore the equal-weight policy mean is bounded by (6*(1/2)+0)/7 = 3/7 and (6*(1/2)+1)/7 = 4/7.",
